        {[
          { q: "Is UGC cheaper than influencer marketing?", a: "On a per-video basis, yes. UGC videos cost $50-$300 each with full usage rights. Influencer posts cost $200-$10,000+ depending on follower count, and usage rights are often extra. The bigger cost advantage is in distribution: UGC runs as paid ads under your control, so you set the budget and optimize for performance. Influencer reach is a one-time organic burst with limited targeting. At scale, brands typically see 2-5x better cost-per-acquisition from UGC ad creative compared to boosted influencer content." },
          { q: "Can I use UGC and influencer marketing together?", a: "Yes, and the best-performing brands do. The most effective hybrid model uses influencer partnerships for brand awareness and community credibility while running UGC as the primary paid ad creative. Whitelisted ads (running paid promotions through an influencer's handle using UGC-style content) combine the authenticity of influencer endorsement with the targeting and measurement of paid advertising." },
          { q: "Which model is better for e-commerce?", a: "UGC is typically the stronger choice for e-commerce, especially for direct-response advertising. Product demos, unboxing videos, and testimonials from real-looking creators consistently outperform polished brand creative in paid ad campaigns. The ability to A/B test different UGC videos and scale winners makes it ideal for performance-driven e-commerce brands. Influencer marketing can complement UGC for product launches or reaching niche communities, but UGC should be the core content engine for e-commerce ad accounts." },
          { q: "How do I measure ROI for UGC vs influencer campaigns?", a: "UGC used as paid ad creative is measured through your ad platform's standard metrics: CPA, ROAS, CTR, and conversion rate. The attribution is clear because you control the distribution. Influencer marketing ROI is harder to measure — promo codes and UTM links capture some conversions, but much of the impact (brand awareness, word-of-mouth, social proof) is indirect. For a fair comparison, track both total spend and total attributed conversions across both channels over a 90-day period." },
          { q: "Does OKAD handle both UGC and influencer campaigns?", a: "We specialize in UGC production and creator management. Our network of 700+ creators produces ad-ready content for brands across industries. We handle briefs, creator matching, production, quality control, and delivery. For influencer distribution, we can produce whitelisted content that runs through creator handles as partnership ads. Write to us at olga@okad.agency to discuss your strategy." },
        ].map((item) => (
          <div class="faq-item border-b border-border">
            <div class="faq-q flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-5 cursor-pointer">
